%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: IsActorInCombatWithPlayer(NPC)
goto: PlayerCombatBranch

cond: IsActorInCombat(NPC)
goto: CombatBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: PlayerCombatBranch
npc: Alright, speak up. Why the hell are you attacking me?
#
o_text: I'm sorry, I didn't mean to attack you.
o_goto: Apology
#
o_text: Because I can.
o_goto: BecauseICan

name: Apology
npc: Fine, just don't do it again.
effect: EndHostility
effect: EndConversation

name: BecauseICan
npc: You're a real piece of work, you know that?
effect: EndConversation

name: CombatBranch
npc: I'm kind of busy right now.
effect: EndConversation

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Where to, stranger?
#
o_text: Just drive.
o_goto: Drive
#
o_text: Take me home.
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_residential_south')
o_goto: DriveHome
#
o_text: Get me to the eastern rim district (Cognetic Bastards & La Boom).
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_commerce')
o_goto: EasternRim
#
o_text: Drop me off in the eastern residential district.
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_residential_east')
o_goto: ResidentialEast
#
o_text: Take me to the western residential district.
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_residential_west')
o_goto: ResidentialWest
#
o_text: Get me to the Terra Vitae headquarters.
o_cond: !IsMap('hq_terra_vitae')
o_goto: TerraVitae
#
o_text: Nevermind.
o_goto: Bye

name: Bye
npc: Alright, see you around.
effect: EndConversation

name: Drive
npc: Sure thing.
#
o_text: (Wait)
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: DriveHome
npc: Home sweet home.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_residential_south', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: EasternRim
npc: You got it.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_commerce', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: ResidentialEast
npc: Sure, the east side it is.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_residential_east', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: ResidentialWest
npc: The west side, no problem.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_residential_west', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: TerraVitae
npc: Terra Vitae. Fancy place, that.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'hq_terra_vitae', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(20)
effect: EndWithChatter
